   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every box = the LLM proposing a thought.  Every score = the LLM judging it.\nSo: many calls. Compares paths at EVERY step (self-consistency only at the end).\nGame of 24: CoT 4% -> ToT 74%. Pays off on search problems with dead ends.",
   "originalText": "Every box = the LLM proposing a thought.  Every score = the LLM judging it.\nSo: many calls. Compares paths at EVERY step (self-consistency only at the end).\nGame of 24: CoT 4% -> ToT 74%. Pays off on search problems with dead ends.",
